---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "@/components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
import LanguageToggle from "@/components/LanguageToggle.astro";
import BackToTopButton from "@/components/BackToTopButton.astro";
import Breadcrumb from "@/components/Breadcrumb.astro";
---

<Layout title="About | SecurityOn Research Journey">
  <Header />

  <Breadcrumb />

  <main id="main-content" class="app-layout pt-8 pb-0 sm:pt-12">
    <!-- =========================================================
         Header
    ========================================================== -->
    <section class="border-border border-b pb-10">
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6">
        <div>
          <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
            About
          </h1>

          <p
            data-lang="ko"
            class="ko-body text-skin-base/75 mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-7"
          >
            IT와 보안 분야에서 쌓아온 실무 경험을 바탕으로 AI Security를
            공부하고 연구하는 과정을 기록하고 있습니다.
          </p>

          <p
            data-lang="en"
            class="text-skin-base/75 mt-4 hidden max-w-2xl leading-7"
          >
            I document my continuing journey from professional practice in IT
            and security towards graduate study and research in AI Security.
          </p>
        </div>

        <LanguageToggle />
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- =========================================================
         Profile
    ========================================================== -->
    <section class="border-border border-b py-10">
      <p class="text-accent text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.16em] uppercase">
        Profile
      </p>

      <h2 data-lang="ko" class="ko-ui mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold">
        반석 · BAN Seok
      </h2>

      <h2 data-lang="en" class="mt-3 hidden text-2xl font-semibold">
        BAN Seok · 반석
      </h2>

      <p class="text-skin-base/60 mt-2 text-sm">
        IT & Security Engineer · M.S. Student
      </p>

      <p
        data-lang="ko"
        class="ko-body text-skin-base/80 mt-5 max-w-3xl leading-7"
      >
        인터넷 서비스, 네트워크 인프라, 정보보안, 클라우드 및 SRE 분야에서 실무
        경험을 쌓아왔습니다. 현재 삼성SDS에서 Network SRE 업무를 수행하고
        있으며, 국립공주대학교 테크노융합대학원 IT융합 석사과정에서 AI와 보안의
        접점을 공부하고 있습니다. 실무에서 접한 문제를 연구 가능한 질문으로
        발전시키고, 배우고 실험하고 실패하고 수정하는 과정을 이곳에 기록하고자
        합니다.
      </p>

      <p
        data-lang="en"
        class="text-skin-base/80 mt-5 hidden max-w-3xl leading-7"
      >
        My professional experience spans Internet services, network
        infrastructure, information security, cloud computing, and SRE. I
        currently work in Network SRE at Samsung SDS while pursuing an M.S. in
        IT Convergence at Kongju National University. My goal is to transform
        problems encountered in real enterprise environments into researchable
        questions at the intersection of artificial intelligence and security,
        while documenting the process of learning, experimentation, failure, and
        revision.
      </p>

      <!-- Public / Professional Profiles -->
      <div
        class="text-skin-base/60 mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-sm"
      >
        <a
          href="https://github.com/securityon"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="hover:text-accent"
